      "source": "hn",
      "url": "https://martinfowler.com/articles/tests-as-data.html",
      "date": "2026-11-13",
      "authors": [
        "Matteo Vaccari"
      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand how structuring tests as data rather than executable code keeps AI assistants from compromising test suites. You will learn practical techniques to preserve human intent using tabular specifications and approval tests.",
